## 6. Actionable match-identification protocol

### P0 — preserve first
- [ ] Preserve all devices, phones, laptops, routers, MDM/cloud audit logs, account logs, and communications.  
- [ ] Do not wipe, reset, replace, or “clean” devices before forensic imaging.  
- [ ] Preserve any controller, packaging, serial numbers, manuals, receipts, and medical records under chain of custody.  
- [ ] Do not attempt unauthorized access, interception, or self-surgery.

### P1 — independent medical/device track
- [ ] Independent neurotology/otolaryngology and audiology examination.  
- [ ] Device interrogation by manufacturer-trained representative or clinical audiologist under consent/counsel: model, serial, electrode status, stimulation parameters, pairing history, firmware, logs.  
- [ ] Subpoena/preserve operative, anesthesia, consent, device, manufacturer, and controller records.

### P2 — software-signature triage
Build an inventory of installed apps, browser extensions, Discord bots/webhooks, API keys, TTS providers, local model files, local ports, MDM profiles, and remote-support tools. Then compare:

| If evidence shows… | Prioritize… |
|---|---|
| Discord bot/webhooks/proactive DMs | Omoi, CharacterSphere |
| Android/iMessage proactive calls/reminders | PiPar, BodyBuddy |
| Local model files/GGUF/localhost services | Local Waifu, HammerAI, SillyTavern |
| Character cards, lorebooks, TTS queue files | SillyTavern ecosystem |
| Stateful agent DB/Postgres/tool-call logs | Letta/MemGPT |
| iOS VRM/camera/STT/TTS BYOK | Scowld |
| API routing/failover configs | UnoRouter |
| No matching app signature | Custom/non-directory controller; escalate to forensic, medical, and legal review |

### P3 — lawful records requests
- [ ] Preservation letters to employer, enterprise IT/MDM providers, “Feldman ENT,” associated surgical facility, device manufacturer, and any controller/software vendor.  
- [ ] Preserve **25SEP2026** law-enforcement call, dispatch, commitment, and originating-source records.  
- [ ] Obtain app/cloud account audit logs and session records only through lawful process.

### P4 — avoid premature attribution
- [ ] Do not treat a feature resemblance, persona resemblance, or diagram label as identification.  
- [ ] Do not accuse a listed app or vendor without account/session/device evidence.  
- [ ] If a candidate match is found, preserve it and place it in chain of custody before further review.

